menu "SensorArray USB data interface"
config SENSORARRAY_USB_OTG
    bool "USB-OTG scientific data/control and independent CDC debug"
    default y
    depends on IDF_TARGET_ESP32S3
    help
        Uses the shared internal PHY exclusively. Serial/JTAG remains the ROM
        download path. The backend below selects dual CDC or vendor bulk.
        Disable for the legacy Serial/JTAG build; never install both stacks.
config SENSORARRAY_USB_OTG_CDC
    bool "Use dual CDC (formal data/control + separate debug)"
    default y
    depends on SENSORARRAY_USB_OTG
    help
        CDC0 carries scientific records and command replies in one ordered
        stream. CDC1 is an independent best-effort debug port. Disable for
        the development vendor-bulk backend, which requires libusb/WinUSB.
endmenu
